 rren County! Find out about our strategies to engage voters\, make candida
 tes accountable\, our Visibility Brigade\, Finding Kean Washington Bor.\, 
 Purple light campaign\, post carding\, meet and greet candidates\, canvass
 ing and more. If you wondered if you are the only one\, come see that you 
 are not! It's a great opportunity to connect with our like minded communit
 y 
LOCATION:Washington\, NJ
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ionj/event/945649/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible One NJ (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
